              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhanchaama abhanene hamui na Abhabharisayo nkanyoora bhaagamba iga örë wonsui arëmaaha Yesö, ache köbhahërra amang'ana korri agootoe.",
